Package: scaleinn-cli
# The code is pure Python. "amd64" matches the requested file name
# (scaleinn-cli_1.0.0_amd64.deb); change to "all" to get one package for every
# architecture (scaleinn-cli_1.0.0_all.deb).
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${python3:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Command-line interface for the Scaleinn cloud platform
 The Scaleinn CLI is a lightweight client for the Scaleinn backend APIs. It
 lets you sign in (root or IAM user), select a project, and manage cloud
 resources such as Object Storage buckets and CTs (Linux Containers) from the
 terminal.
 .
 Configuration and tokens are stored per user in ~/.scaleinn and are not
 removed when the package is uninstalled.
